  "event": {
    "title": "Paw Prints Calm K9 Corner",
    "tagline": "Because BarkFest can be a lot—even for the goodest dogs.",
    "subtitle": "BarkFest 2026 · Booth plan & production checklist",
    "facts": [
      {
        "label": "Green light",
        "value": "Leanne handed Rob the lead on 6 Aug — planning, coordination, sourcing and ordering. Small decisions do not need checking. ONE consolidated estimated budget is required before the larger orders are placed."
      },
      {
        "label": "Event",
        "value": "BarkFest 2026 — Saturday 26 and Sunday 27 September, 10:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m."
      },
      {
        "label": "Booth size",
        "value": "10' x 10' — quieter corner location being arranged by Yoko"
      },
      {
        "label": "Layout",
        "value": "Split by a pipe-and-drape divider: 10' x 5' public-facing front + 10' x 5' Calm K9 Corner at the back"
      },
      {
        "label": "Draping",
        "value": "Black draping IS included in the booth fee (Yoko). Only extra pipe-and-drape to section off a space costs more. We do not need to buy curtains."
      },
      {
        "label": "Expected attendance",
        "value": "~7,000 people and ~2,000 dogs last year — drives all giveaway quantities"
      },
      {
        "label": "Power",
        "value": "15 Amp single outlet, standard 3-prong, already booked ($65 venue fee). Power bar allowed — 1,800W absolute, ~1,440W safe continuous across TV, PEMF bed, 2 PEMF mats, fan, speaker and laptop."
      },
      {
        "label": "VIP Wag Bags",
        "value": "BarkFest will do 500-1,000 bags and asks a minimum of 250 items per contributor. Paw Prints is contributing stickers only (Leanne, 8 Aug). Delivery deadline still outstanding."
      },
      {
        "label": "Look & feel",
        "value": "Clean, primarily black and white, with Paw Prints light blue and grey as accents"
      },
      {
        "label": "Floor plan",
        "value": "Outstanding with Yoko."
      },
      {
        "label": "Move-in",
        "value": "Friday 25 September, 9:00 a.m. to 9:00 p.m. Teardown timing still to be confirmed with Yoko."
      },
      {
        "label": "Event contact",
        "value": "Yoko Chapman — Producer, BarkFest / Publisher, BARKS + BONES Magazine — Yoko@moonandstarsproductions.ca. Introduced 6 Aug; contact her directly on booth specs, floor plan, power, load-in, tables and the divider."
      },
      {
        "label": "Venue",
        "value": "Red River Exhibition Park, Winnipeg."
      },
      {
        "label": "Divider",
        "value": "Additional 8′ pipe-and-drape divider ordered 21 Jul. Own curtains may be hung if they have a ~3″ rod pocket / casing. Pins are fine for lightweight signage."
      },
      {
        "label": "Key deadline",
        "value": "Magazine ad artwork due 1 September 2026. VIP Wag Bag stuffing deadline still unknown — BarkFest is waiting on our item count."
      },
      {
        "label": "Booth",
        "value": "Currently a 10x10 corner booth ($695, paid) + 15A outlet ($65) + extra 8ft pipe-and-drape divider ($75). UNDER REVIEW — a $2,000 Dog Spaw sponsorship would take it to 10x15 with a 1/4 page ad and web advertising included. See the sponsorship card."
      },
      {
        "label": "Tables",
        "value": "NOT provided by the event. Rentable through BarkFest, or we bring our own."
      },
      {
        "label": "Magazine",
        "value": "BARKS + BONES. 1/8 $175, 1/4 $275, 1/2 $425, full $700. Trim 8.375in x 10.875in. Artwork due 1 September. Rob is designing it."
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "The vision",
        "items": [
          "A calm, welcoming space where dogs can stop for a few minutes to relax and recharge while their owners learn about Paw Prints.",
          "Set up like a little dog spa / lounge — while dogs are pampered, owners chat with us about ultrasound, wellness and our services.",
          "Complimentary 10-minute calming sessions: Water · Massage · PEMF · Quiet Time."
        ]
      },
      {
        "heading": "Front (public-facing) 10' x 5'",
        "items": [
          "Merch / info table — small rectangular folding table",
          "Cocktail table",
          "Free stickers (assorted fun dog stickers + Paw Prints vinyl sticker)",
          "Water bottles and collapsible dog bowls, while supplies last",
          "Cooling bandanas (leftovers from the golf tournament — dogs or people)",
          "Business cards",
          "TV running the ultrasound loop, laptop as backup",
          "“MSK Ultrasound — Coming Soon” tabletop display + one-page MSK info sheet",
          "QR code to the website / referral form"
