          "No business card reorder — Leanne still has plenty.",
          "Printed table runner over a plain black tablecloth, NOT a fitted stretch cover — keeps flexibility for different tables.",
          "Individual bowls and bottles per dog rather than one shared water bowl (a larger refill container still on hand).",
          "Dog bowl logo prints on the OUTSIDE of the bowl, not inside where the water goes.",
          "One Paw Prints sticker design, not several — Leanne already bought an assortment of fun dog stickers for people to pick from.",
          "Small TV over laptop-only for the ultrasound loop — far easier for passers-by to see.",
          "No custom magnets — 2\" die-cut vinyl stickers only, from Sticker Mule (6 Aug).",
          "No photo backdrop — not enough room with the 10′×5′ split (6 Aug).",
          "No communal water bowls and no shared refill station — individual bottle and keepable collapsible bowl per dog (6 Aug).",
          "Holter and MSK get separate signs, not one combined \"what’s new\" sign (6 Aug).",
          "Small quiet fan is the main setup; the industrial fan is backup only (6 Aug).",
          "No cooling mats ordered until Leanne checks what she already has (6 Aug).",
          "Tagline resolved 7 Aug — \"We See Your Dog From the Inside Out\" (the most recent version). The July \"We See Dogs From the Inside Out\" given to BarkFest is superseded.",
