          "a": "",
          "who": "Yoko"
        },
        {
          "q": "Leanne to approve the $1,750 sponsorship. Note her 10 Aug steer to keep costs reasonable — this is roughly $700 above the plain booth path if the $695 credits.",
          "a": "",
          "who": "Leanne"
        },
        {
          "q": "What closes the gap between the $1,795 of itemised value and the $2,000 ask?",
          "a": "ANSWERED 12 Aug: nothing was added — the two figures were built on different bases. $1,795 was a-la-carte list pricing; the sponsor package prices the booth below list. She has since moved the offer to $1,750 and reinstated the 10 tickets."
        },
        {
          "q": "If we upgrade, does the $695 already paid credit against the sponsorship?",
