      "notes": "HARD DEADLINE 1 September 2026 — from the BarkFest vendor application: \"Do you require our FREE Ad / Editorial Design Service? Ad Artwork Deadline September 1, 2026.\" Yoko is the publisher and editor of BARKS + BONES. This was never on the checklist and is the earliest real deadline on the project — roughly three weeks out. Free design service is on offer if we would rather brief it than build it. Magazine trim is 8.375in w x 10.875in h. A geometric quarter would be 4.1875 x 5.4375, but interior ads sit inside margins so the published spec is normally smaller, and \"quarter page\" may be vertical, horizontal or square. Get the rate card before starting.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "q": "What ad sizes, specs and rates are available, and what did our registration already include?",
          "a": "Yoko: 1/8 pg $175, 1/4 pg $275, 1/2 pg $425, full pg $700. Magazine trim 8.375in w x 10.875in h. Free design service available but we are designing it. Registration already included a $50/yr Top Dog web listing (125x125px), no magazine ad."
        },
