          "a": "Leanne, 8 Aug: Rob designs it. \"Since you're already handling the branding/design for BarkFest, I'd much rather have you design the ad so everything is cohesive.\" Get specs from Yoko and run with it."
        },
        {
          "q": "Ad spec sheet needed before design starts: exact 1/4 page dimensions and orientation (vertical / horizontal / square), bleed and safety margins if any, colour space and resolution (assume CMYK 300dpi), file format (assume press-ready PDF), and where artwork goes. NOTE: do not derive dimensions from the 8.375x10.875 trim — that is the finished page, not the ad area. A geometric quarter would be 4.1875 x 5.4375 but the real spec is usually smaller and may be a different shape.",
