      "notes": "Quantity is driven by ~7,000 people / ~2,000 dogs last year. Given away while supplies last. Leanne, 6 Aug: send tiered pricing before ordering. Individual bottle + keepable bowl per dog — no communal bowls, no shared refill station. PRODUCT CHECK: this is a *labelled bottle of water*, not a reusable branded bottle — Leanne asked for \"water bottle labels\" (23 Jul) and \"a Paw Prints-branded bottle of water\" (6 Aug). Cheap per unit, but 500 x 500ml is roughly 250kg to transport, store and keep cool, and it is a poor VIP-bag insert on weight alone. Price the label separately from the water. LEAD TIME: longest-lead item on the board and still unpriced. Custom promo typically runs 2-4 weeks production plus shipping — ordering needs to happen by roughly end of August for a 25 Sept move-in. STILL TO PRICE: 500 labelled 500ml bottles. ~21 cases, ~250kg, needs a vehicle but no cooling.",
