      "notes": "Hard requirement: logo on the OUTSIDE of the bowl, not inside where the water goes. Paired with the bottles so each dog gets their own — no shared bowl. Leanne, 6 Aug: send tiered pricing before ordering. Individual bottle + keepable bowl per dog — no communal bowls, no shared refill station. Bowls are the natural VIP Wag Bag insert — light, flat, keepable, and branded on the outside. Yoko volunteered exactly this on 21 Jul. If bowls go in the bags, quantity could jump from ~500 to 1,000+, so price a 1,000 tier as well. LEAD TIME: longest-lead item on the board and still unpriced. Custom promo typically runs 2-4 weeks production plus shipping — ordering needs to happen by roughly end of August for a 25 Sept move-in. PRICED 7 Aug — 4imprint.ca \"Tag Along Collapsible Pet Bowl\" 4in (C131352-4), silicone, 8oz, carabiner, one-colour imprint included, $65 one-time setup, ships in 8 business days. CAD tiers: 100=$5.25, 200=$4.95, 500=$4.69, 1000=$4.59, 2500=$4.39. Quantities between breaks pay the lower break, so 1,500 sits at the 1,000 price. ALL-IN: 500 = $2,410 | 1,000 = $4,655 | 1,500 = $6,950. For scale that is roughly 19x the sticker line at the same quantity. If bowls go into the 1,000 VIP bags that alone is $4,655. Lead time is comfortable for a 25 Sept move-in; cost is the issue, not the calendar. QUOTES 7 Aug (4imprint.ca, CAD, all-in incl. $65 setup, 1-colour, 8 business days). LIKE-FOR-LIKE on the two large collapsibles: Tag Along 7in SILICONE 32oz (C131352-7) — 500 $3,090 / 1,000 $5,915 / 1,500 $8,840; 4.6/5 from 5 reviews; collapses to 3/4in; imprint is a 3.5in circle described as \"centre of the bowl\" so likely the base, possibly inside — conflicts with Leanne's outside-only rule. On the Go VINYL 24oz (C140304) — 500 $2,960 / 1,000 $5,215 / 1,500 $7,790; cheaper at every tier; no ratings; snap-fold; imprint areas FRONT 1x3in (outside wall) + BOTTOM 4in. RECOMMENDED. Also priced: Tag Along 4in silicone 8oz — 500 $2,410 / 1,000 $4,655 (too small at one cup). rushIMPRINT.ca collapsible — 500 $3,550 / 1,000 $6,820, 47%% dearer. Vistaprint.ca carries no collapsible bowl (one ceramic dish, out of stock). BannerBuzz is signage only. Budget option: 4imprint rigid plastic dish 500 $1,060 / 1,000 $1,985, imprint on the side, but not collapsible, 8in wide and only 2.7/5. Nobody ever specified silicone — Leanne only said \"collapsible portable bowl\", logo outside. ACTION: request free samples of the 7in silicone and the vinyl before committing. COST: 4imprint On the Go vinyl bowl, 500 @ $5.79 + $65 setup. Recommended option/qty — changes to $5,215 at 1,000 if bowls go in the VIP bags. Leanne, 10 Aug: \"I'd like to keep the giveaway costs as reasonable as possible, especially the collapsible bowls, so let's make sure we're not overspending there just because we can.\"",
